      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Algo for crreating MAX HEAP\n--------------------------------------\n\n1. Add the element at the last .\n\n2. Compare the element with its parent .\n\n  a. If element is smaller then parent then return .\n\n  b if element is greater than parent swap it with its parent and\ngoto step 2 .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Algo for crreating MAX HEAP\n--------------------------------------\n\n1. Add the element at the last .\n\n2. Compare the element with its parent .\n\n  a. If element is smaller then parent then return .\n\n  b if element is greater than parent swap it with its parent and goto step 2 .",
